{
  "The ShowAsMonochrome property (true by default) will result in a solid block of the foreground color if the property is set to true and the icon is more than one color. This behavior can be ignored by setting the ShowAsMonochrome property to false.": "ShowAsMonochrome 属性（默认值为 true）启用时，若图标包含多种颜色，会将图标显示为纯前景色。将该属性设为 false 可保留图标原有颜色。",
  "Monochrome": "单色（Monochrome）",
  "Use FontIcon as the icon for a control if you want to specify a Glyph value from a FontFamily. Windows 10 uses the Segoe MDL2 Assets FontFamily and that is what this example is showing.": "如果要从 FontFamily 中指定 Glyph 值，可以使用 FontIcon 作为控件图标。本例展示的是 Windows 10 使用的 Segoe MDL2 Assets 字体。",
  "To use an ImageIcon as the icon for a control, you can set image that has a file format supported by the Image class. The two examples here show a PNG and SVG image as the icon.": "要使用 ImageIcon 作为控件图标，可设置 Image 类支持的图片文件。本例分别使用 PNG 和 SVG 图片作为图标。",
  "To use a PathIcon as the icon for a control, you specify the path data of the image you are trying to display. The path data draws a series of connected lines and curves.": "要使用 PathIcon 作为控件图标，请指定图像的路径数据。路径数据由一系列相连的直线和曲线组成。",
  "To use a SymbolIcon as the icon for a control, you specify the enum value for the glyph you would like to display. SymbolIcon's enum is based off of icons from the Segoe MDL2 font used by Windows 10.": "要使用 SymbolIcon 作为控件图标，请指定要显示图标对应的枚举值。SymbolIcon 的枚举基于 Windows 10 使用的 Segoe MDL2 字体图标。",
