  "This is a basic ItemsView which uses its default StackLayout layout and a simple ItemTemplate.": "这是一个基础 ItemsView 示例，使用默认的 StackLayout 布局和简单的 ItemTemplate。",
  "Hit the Enter key, double-click or double-tap an item to invoke it.": "按 Enter 键、双击或双击触摸某个项目即可调用它。",
  "Use the options on the right to control different layout customizations to the ItemsView below.": "使用右侧选项调整下方 ItemsView 的布局。",
  "You can enable four different selection modes on the right.": "可以使用右侧选项启用四种不同的选择模式。",
  "disables selection all together.": "：完全禁用选择。",
  "Single": "单选（Single）",
  "allows for only one item to be selected in the collection.": "：只允许选中集合中的一个项目。",
  "Multiple": "多选（Multiple）",
  "causes checkboxes to appear within the items, so that multiple items can be chosen from the collection.": "：在项目中显示复选框，因此可以从集合中选择多个项目。",
  "Extended": "扩展选择（Extended）",
  "allows the user to select multiple items by using Ctrl+Click to select the individual items they want, or Shift+Click to select a range of contiguous items.": "：用户可按住 Ctrl 并单击选择多个项目，或按住 Shift 并单击选择连续范围。",
  "allows for only one item to be selected in the list.": "：列表中只允许选中一个项目。",
  "causes checkboxes to appear next to items, so that multiple items can be chosen from the list.": "：项目旁会显示复选框，因此可以从列表中选择多个项目。",
  "This ListView allows users to right click to open a context menu. In this case, the context menu provides the option to delete an entry.": "此 ListView 支持右键打开上下文菜单；本例中的菜单提供删除条目的选项。",
  "In these ListView controls, you can drag and drop within a list to reorder items, or drag and drop between lists to move items.": "在这些 ListView 控件中，可以在列表内拖放项目以重新排序，也可以在列表之间拖放项目以移动项目。",
  "Switch the toggle on the right to enable sticky group headers, which makes the headers stay put at the top of the ListView while scrolling.": "打开右侧开关可启用固定分组标题，使标题在滚动 ListView 时始终停留在顶部。",
  "Filter by...": "筛选条件…",
